contentMarkdown:
This model was designed to hold 1 French identity card (from before our new credit card format version), 1 driver's license (the pink document) and 2 cards on the side pockets.

You can even slip in some receipts and subway tickets.

The 2 leathers used are oiled leathers that change color when handled (they become lighter if stretched), they are very qualitative and make it a high quality product.

